---
layout: base.njk
title: Absensi & Kas
description: "Data absensi dan kas bulanan {{ site.nama_organisasi }}."
permalink: /absensi-kas/
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:8px;">
  <div class="wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; padding-bottom:40px;">
    <span class="eyebrow-note">Transparansi</span>
    <h1>{{ absensi.judul }}</h1>
    <p class="lead measure-wide">{{ absensi.keterangan }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 14" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 7 Q 10 0 20 7 T 40 7 T 60 7 T 80 7 T 100 7 T 120 7 T 140 7 T 160 7 T 180 7 T 200 7 T 220 7 T 240 7 T 260 7 T 280 7 T 300 7 T 320 7 T 340 7 T 360 7 T 380 7 T 400 7" stroke="#1f4d3a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/></svg></div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if absensi.embed_url %}
    <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff;">
      <iframe src="{{ absensi.embed_url }}" title="{{ absensi.judul }}" style="width:100%; height:640px; border:0; display:block;" loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:0.88rem; margin-top:10px;">Data diperbarui otomatis setiap kali bendahara mengubah Google Sheets sumbernya.</p>
    {% else %}
    <div class="placeholder-note" style="max-width:74ch;">
      Belum ada tautan Google Sheets yang dipasang. Admin: buka Google Sheets → File → Share → Publish to web →
      pilih sheet yang ingin ditampilkan → salin tautan embed (bentuknya diawali <code>https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/...</code>)
      → tempelkan ke kolom "URL Embed Google Sheets" pada panel admin CMS.
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
